    {
      "id": "pronoun-genitive",
      "number": "40",
      "heading": "Possessive (Genitive) Forms",
      "statement": "Each nominative has a genitive used for possession and before many postpositions: **আমার**, **তোর**, **তোমার**, **আপনার**, **তার**, **তাঁর**. Plurals take **-দের**: আমাদের, তোমাদের, আপনাদের, তাদের, তাঁদের.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "target": "আমার বই",
          "roman": "amar boi",
          "gloss": "my book"
        },
        {
          "target": "তোমার বাড়ি",
          "roman": "tomar baṛi",
          "gloss": "your (familiar) house"
        },
        {
          "target": "আপনার নাম",
          "roman": "apnar nam",
          "gloss": "your (polite) name"
        }
      ],
