      "id": "bn501-p1",
      "type": "comprehension",
      "difficulty": "hard",
      "title": "At the door",
      "passage": "রীতাঃ আপনার নাম কি?\nঅতিথিঃ আমার নাম করিম। আপনি কে?\nরীতাঃ আমি রীতা। উনি আমার বাবা।\nঅতিথিঃ তাঁকে নমস্কার।\nরীতাঃ (বাবার দিকে) তিনি বলছেন, তুমি ভিতরে এসো।",
      "romanization": "Rītā: apnar nam ki?\nOtithi: amar nam Korim. apni ke?\nRītā: ami Rītā. uni amar baba.\nOtithi: tãke nômoskar.\nRītā: (babar dike) tini bolchen, tumi bhitore eso.",
      "translation": "Rita: What is your (polite) name?\nGuest: My name is Karim. Who are you (polite)?\nRita: I am Rita. That gentleman is my father.\nGuest: Greetings to him (polite).\nRita: (toward father) He (polite) says, you (familiar) come inside.",
      "glossary": {
        "অতিথি": "guest",
        "উনি": "that person (polite demonstrative)",
        "নমস্কার": "greeting",
        "দিকে": "toward",
        "বলছেন": "is saying (polite progressive)",
        "ভিতরে": "inside",
        "এসো": "come (familiar imperative)"
      },
      "scriptCritical": false,
